// ============================================================================
// TrailPeak Outfitters - HOLO
// The "almost 3D" landing page: the same store network, drawn as a tilted
// ground plane with a light column standing over each store.
// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
// Renderer : trailpeak/trailpeak-home.js, mode 'holo'
// Serve    : https://cdn.statically.io/gh/sulaiman013/dax-with-js
//              @trailpeak-home-v5.0.0/trailpeak/trailpeak-home.js
//
// WHY THIS MEASURE IS THREE LINES AND NOT THREE HUNDRED
// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
// This page needs EXACTLY the payload [JS Home Page] already produces: the same
// dimensions, the same store x month and product x store grain, the same
// escaping and the same guards. The only difference is which layout the
// renderer draws.
//
// Copying 300 lines of DAX to change one word would create two things that must
// be kept in step by hand and silently would not be. So the payload has one
// source of truth and this measure derives from it, injecting a single mode
// flag. If the contract changes, both pages change together, by construction.
//
// The substitution is deliberately narrow:
//
//   "window.__tpHome={meta:"  ->  "window.__tpHome={mode:'holo',meta:"
//
// It matches once, at the head of the object literal, and it cannot match
// inside any data value because a store name cannot contain that sequence: the
// escape chain in [JS Home Page] turns every "<" into < and every quote
// into an escaped quote before the value is ever concatenated.
//
// When [JS Home Page] returns its no-data guard instead of a payload, that
// string contains no match and passes through untouched, so this page shows the
// same guard rather than a broken payload.
// ============================================================================

JS Holo Page =
VAR _base = [JS Home Page]
RETURN
    SUBSTITUTE (
        _base,
        "window.__tpHome={meta:",
        "window.__tpHome={mode:'holo',meta:"
    )
